## Project Showcase

### Project Title: CISC7204 Data Science and Data Visualization Labs
* **Research Question:** How can exploratory data analysis, data cleaning pipelines, and statistical modeling techniques be systematically applied to uncover underlying trends, evaluate predictive regression performance, and communicate insights effectively?

#### Visualization & Findings
* **Approach:** Integrated structured data cleaning, statistical validation, and visual storytelling principles. Key visual evaluations focused on feature distributions, correlation heatmaps, and regression residuals ($R^2$, Mean Absolute Error, and Root Mean Squared Error metrics) to assess predictive accuracy.
* **Summary Table:**

| Analysis Module | Key Focus | Outcome / Validation |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Module 01 - Lab 01** | Data cleaning, parsing POS orders, and string compression algorithms | Validated robust string and numerical data pipelines |
| **Module 01 - Lab 02** | Exploratory data visualization and statistical distribution mapping | Identified key feature correlations and reduced visual clutter |

